s Intel holding and initiated positions in AMD and SpaceX, signalling a shift toward semiconductor exposure and emerging technology opportunities, according to filings.\n\n(What's moving Sensex and Nifty Track latest market news, stock tips, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment strategies and stocks alerts, subscribe to our Telegram feeds .)\n\nSubscribe to ET Prime and read the Economi", "citation": "US Stock Market: Tiger Global trims big tech bets, adds AMD and SpaceX in Q2 \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-17. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/wall-street-guide/us-stock-market-tiger-global-trims-big-tech-bets-adds-amd-and-spacex-in-q2/articleshow/133286709.cms"}, {"title": "Tech Mahindra Share Price Live Updates: Tech Mahindra News", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-17T03:57:14+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/tech-mahindra-share-price-live-17-aug-2026/liveblog/133286151.cms", "status": "partial", "excerpt": "", "citation": "Tech Mahindra Share Price Live Updates: Tech Mahindra News \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-17. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/tech-mahindra-share-price-live-17-aug-2026/liveblog/133286151.cms"}, {"title": "Why Goldman Sachs thinks there may be an \u2018earnings bubble\u2019 in tech?", "feed": "BusinessLine Mkts", "ts": "2026-08-16T09:16:29+00:00", "url": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/why-goldman-sachs-thinks-there-may-be-an-earnings-bubble-in-tech/article71352404.ece", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "The five biggest stocks in the US now have a P/E ratio only marginally above the other 495 stocks in the S&P 500 after consistently trading at a premium since 2017.\n\nTechnology stocks do not appear to be in a valuation bubble despite rising growth expectations, but there could be an \"earnings bubble\" 